  <p>The system is a small, cohesive Python package with clearly separated responsibilities. Control flows
  left-to-right; the authoritative data path is the intercepted JSON-RPC response.</p>

  <div class="flow">
    <div class="step"><span class="t">Authenticate</span><span class="d">persistent context, login</span></div>
    <div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="step"><span class="t">Navigate&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Filter</span><span class="d">deep-link, clear, Posted</span></div>
    <div class="arrow">→</div>
    <div class="step"><span class="t">Locate&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Open</span><span class="d">match row, click</span></div>
    <div class="arrow">→</div>
